    dict(key='15-act-4-figure', kind='figure', title='The same nine attacks, before and after the fix',
         body='nine_attacks_after',
         narration="Fourth demo: one choke point, deny by default. [[slnc 400]] The same nine attacks, now side by side. [[slnc 300]] On the left, before the fix. [[slnc 300]] On the right, after it. [[slnc 700]] Before, seven red answers of two hundred. [[slnc 300]] After, none. [[slnc 600]] Look at the codes. [[slnc 300]] Someone else's order now answers four oh four, the same as a missing order. [[slnc 300]] Signed out answers four oh one: sign in first. [[slnc 300]] And the wrong role answers four oh three: forbidden. [[slnc 700]] At the bottom, the honest requests. [[slnc 300]] All six still work. [[slnc 300]] A fix that blocks honest users is not a fix."),
    dict(key='16-act-4-1', kind='console', title='Act Four — One choke point, deny by default',
         body="FOUR. One choke point, deny by default.\n  AFTER THE FIX (one policy before every handler):\n    ana reads ben's order 1002            404\n    ana opens ben's leaked gift link      404\n    ana sends ben's order to her address  404\n    ana cancels ben's order 1002          404\n    signed out, reads the sales report    401\n    ana reads the sales report            403\n    ana refunds order 1002                403\n    ana lists the users                   403\n    ana deletes ben's account             403\n    attacks that succeed: 0 of 9",
         narration='Here is the output. [[slnc 400]] After the fix, the nine attacks: four oh four, four oh one, and four oh three. [[slnc 300]] None succeeds.'),
